#. module: remotecontrol_4egrowth
#: model:remotecontrol,remotecontrol_help:remotecontrol_4egrowth.remotecontrol_4egrowth
msgid "Timestamps are treated as provided by the API (UTC strings) and stored likewise."
msgstr "Les marques de temps es tracten com les proporciona l'API (cadenes UTC) i s'emmagatzemen de la mateixa manera."

#. module: remotecontrol_4egrowth
#: model:remotecontrol,remotecontrol_help:remotecontrol_4egrowth.remotecontrol_4egrowth
